[
  {
    "source": "A ring of adornment protects against Nymphs.",
    "full": "装饰戒指能防水仙女。",
    "compact": "装饰戒指能防仙女。"
  },
  {
    "source": "A spear will hit an ettin.",
    "full": "长矛会击中双头巨人。",
    "compact": "长矛会击中双首。"
  },
  {
    "source": "A xan is a small animal. It doesn't reach higher than your leg.",
    "full": "刺腿虫很小，只到你腿高。",
    "compact": "虻很小，只到你腿高。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Affairs with Nymphs are often very expensive.",
    "full": "与水仙女交往通常很贵。",
    "compact": "与仙女交往通常很贵。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Afraid of Mimics? Try to wear a ring of true seeing.",
    "full": "怕拟态怪？戴真视戒指。",
    "compact": "怕拟怪？戴真视戒指。"
  },
  {
    "source": "An ettin is hard to kill; an imp is hard to hit. See the difference?",
    "full": "双头巨人难杀，小恶魔难打中。",
    "compact": "双首难杀，魔难打中。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Eating a tengu is like eating a Nymph.",
    "full": "吃天狗就像吃水仙女。",
    "compact": "吃天狗就像吃仙女。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Eventually you will come to admire the swift elegance of a retreating nymph.",
    "full": "你终将欣赏水仙女逃跑的优雅。",
    "compact": "你终将欣赏仙女逃跑的优雅。"
  },
  {
    "source": "If a chameleon mimics a mace, it really mimics a Mimic mimicking a mace.",
    "full": "变色龙变钉头锤，其实是变成拟态锤的拟态怪。",
    "compact": "变色龙变钉锤，其实是变成拟态锤的拟怪。"
  },
  {
    "source": "It might be a good idea to offer the unicorn a ruby.",
    "full": "给独角兽红宝石可能是好主意。",
    "compact": "给独角兽红玉可能是好主意。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Not even a spear will hit a Xorn.",
    "full": "连长矛也打不中索恩兽。",
    "compact": "连长矛也打不中索恩。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Nymphs and nurses like beautiful rings.",
    "full": "水仙女和护士喜欢漂亮戒指。",
    "compact": "仙女和护士喜欢漂亮戒指。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Nymphs are very pleased when you call them by their real name: Lorelei.",
    "full": "叫水仙女真名罗蕾莱，她会高兴。",
    "compact": "叫仙女真名罗蕾莱，她会高兴。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Only a Nymph knows how to unlock chains.",
    "full": "只有水仙女知道怎样解开锁链。",
    "compact": "只有仙女知道怎样解开锁链。"
  },
  {
    "source": "Plain nymphs are harmless.",
    "full": "普通水仙女无害。",
    "compact": "普通仙女无害。"
  },
  {
    "source": "There is nothing like eating a Mimic.",
